<https://w3id.org/m11-rdf/C217344.C49236> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The treatment condition of interest and, as appropriate, the alternative treatment condition to which comparison will be made (referred to as \"treatment\" through the remainder of this document). These might be individual interventions, combinations of interventions administered concurrently, e.g. as add-on to standard of care, or might consist of an overall regimen involving a complex sequence of interventions."@en .
